{
    "version": "GitHub Copilot CLI 1.0.110, `copilot --acp --stdio`",
    "source": "Derived from t3code, not recorded: the frame shapes of the replay test in pingdotgg/t3code#36122 (github/copilot-cli#5293). Copilot holds the first session/prompt response while an async shell runs and says its root agent is done with the opt-in github.com/copilot/sessionEvent assistant.idle. The second prompt gets the first one's late response and an idle of the first prompt before its own assistant.turn_start. A test plays these prompts over the recorded handshake of copilot-1.0.101-turn.json.",
